sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor I as Inspector (Mobile)
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant VS as Vehicle Service
  participant S3 as Object Storage
  participant Q as Redis Stream
  participant AI as AI Inspection Service
  participant VAL as Valuation Service
  I->>GW: POST /inspections {vehicleId}
  GW->>VS: create inspection (status = UPLOADING)
  VS-->>I: inspectionId + pre-signed multipart URLs
  loop for each photo chunk
    I->>S3: PUT chunk (resume on failure)
  end
  I->>GW: POST /inspections/{id}/submit
  GW->>VS: mark SUBMITTED
  VS->>Q: XADD inspection.requested
  Q-->>AI: consume message
  AI->>S3: GET images
  AI->>AI: YOLO inference, bounding boxes
  AI->>S3: PUT annotated images
  AI->>Q: XADD inspection.completed {damages}
  Q-->>VS: store damages (status = ANALYZED)
  VS->>VAL: POST /valuations {vehicle, damages}
  VAL-->>VS: suggested price + confidence range
  VS-->>I: push notification / poll → report ready
  Note over I,AI: Inference ≤ 4 s per image
